Matt 15:1 , Christ reproves the Scribes and Pharisees for transgressing God's commandments through their own traditions;
Matt 15:10 , teaches how that which goes into the mouth does not defile a man;
Matt 15:21 , He heals the daughter of the woman of Canaan
Matt 15:29 . and other great multitudes;
Matt 15:32 , and with seven loaves and a few little fishes feeds four thousand men, beside women and children.
